"description":"Predictable is a multi-award winning text-to-speech app for people with conditions such as ALS/MND, autism, cerebral palsy, Down's syndrome, and more. It aims to make it easier and quicker to communicate, using a range of access methods, rate enhancement features and customisation options.\n\nWord Prediction\nUsing smart word prediction technology, the app makes speaking out a text-based message easy. Predictable learns from your pattern of use and predicts what you will type next, making typing easier and more efficient.\n\n\nPhases and categories \nSave and organise phrases that you need quick access to in a simple grid format. Further customise your phrases by adding symbols, images, audio recordings, links and more. \n\n\nShortcuts\nChoose from a wide range of useful and exciting features such as notes, share, translate, chatGPT and draw to customise your keyboard screen to include features that you want to use. Attach these to keyboard keys, hot corners, head tracking gestures or external keyboard shortcuts. The possibilities are endless!\n\n\nMulti Language\nSwitch between any of our 43 languages* to create your personalised bilingual set up. You are able to choose a primary and secondary language and seamlessly transition between both on the go, with appropriate keyboards and voices selected for both. Languages supported include: \nArabic, Bangla, Bulgarian, Catalan, Chinese, Croatian, Danish, Dutch, English, Finnish, French, German, Greek, Hebrew, Hindi, Hungarian, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Kannada, Korean, Maithili, Malay, Marathi, Norwegian (Bokmal), Persian, Polish, Portuguese, Punjabi, Romanian, Russian, Slovak, Spanish, Swedish, Tamil, Telugu, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Gujarati, Urdu, Somali\n*Some languages only offered with online voices \n\n\nSpeech and Voice Options\nCompatible with standard iOS voices, including the enhanced voices available to download and your iOS personal voice. You can also use your voice-banked voice from ModelTalker, Acapela, SpeakUnique and The Voice Keeper.\n\n\nAccessibility\nPredictable offers a wide range of access methods and accessibility settings including:\nDirect touch features to handle accidental selection\nScreen tap - a scanning method where you touch the screen for selection and/or progression\nSwitch access - accessible via Bluetooth switch box + switches (compatible with Therapy Box Switch Box and RJ Cooper Switch Interface) as well as Head tracking face gestures.\nHead tracking - use facial recognition to interact with the app with no calibration or extra hardware required.\nAuditory preview - hear the onscreen text before selection.\nScanning - Build your own, is a brand new access method in Predictable. Customise your own scanning method by combining timer, screen tap, switch access and gestures.\n\nAppearance\nCustomise the layout and appearance to truly optimise the app to your preferences by changing the layout, font size, colours and more. Different keyboard options (including QWERTY, Ten Key, Apple and Bluetooth) and different templates (including Dark, High Contrast and Low vision) are available to make this customisation clear and simple.\n\n\nWeb Platform\nLog in remotely and manage your settings and grid content from our web platform. The web platform is compatible with the myMessageBanking.com format to make importing easy.\n\n\nSupport\nUser guides are available on your app, and on the Therapy Box website. Send any questions to support@therapy-box.co.uk. You can find more about Predictable at https://therapy-box.co.uk/predictable", "sellerUrl":"https://www.therapybox.co.uk/predictable-english", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"1848925184", "formattedPrice":"£149.99", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":217, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.37788000000000021572077457676641643047332763671875, "bundleId":"com.predictable.dist", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "userRatingCount":217}]
